1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
RemoteAssist — Remote Support & Access
LEFT = HOST (controlled)   RIGHT = CONTROLLER

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:14,000
The app icon is always visible in the launcher.
It can never be hidden.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Before enabling Accessibility, the app clearly
explains what it will do.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
It states it does NOT read your screen content
or data from other apps.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
The user grants Accessibility in Android Settings
themselves.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Used ONLY to send taps, swipes, and text
during an approved remote session.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:56,000
The HOST generates a one-time code.
Nothing happens until the host approves.

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:06,000
The CONTROLLER enters the code
to request a connection.

9
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:13,000
The HOST must explicitly approve the session.

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
It sees exactly what will be shared before allowing.

11
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Screen capture begins only after Android's
own system consent dialog.

12
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:35,000
A persistent, non-dismissible notification is shown
the entire time the screen is shared.

13
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Foreground service: mediaProjection.
"End now" stops it instantly.

14
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
The CONTROLLER's taps, swipes, and text
are performed on the HOST in real time.

15
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Accessibility is used only to inject input —
no screen data is read or stored.

16
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Either side can end the session at any time.
The notification clears when it ends.

17
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Paired devices and access can be revoked
at any time.

18
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Unattended access is set up by the device owner,
behind authentication.

19
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Only for a previously paired device —
and it shows its own always-on notification.

20
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:44,000
RemoteAssist — consent required, always visible,
revocable anytime. Never hidden.
